# Phase discipline

- Read `PHASE_STATUS.md` first. Implement only `current_phase`.
- Do not start phase N+1 until phase N is `complete` with evidence in `PHASE_STATUS.md`.
- Do not "get ahead" by building later modules, screens, or engines. Minimal FK stub tables are allowed; UX and engines for later phases are not.
- A phase is done only when `IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP.md` definition of done is met and tests pass.
- After completing a phase, update `PHASE_STATUS.md` and stop unless the user asks to continue.
- Phase 4 requires Phase 2 and Phase 3. Phase 11 AI is forbidden until engines exist.
- Do not mark a phase complete to keep moving.
